3
00:00:04,066 --> 00:00:07,900
他们3点的时候会做包子
tā men sān diǎn de shí hòu huì zuò bāo zi
They start making buns at 3 a.m.

4
00:00:07,933 --> 00:00:09,466
会做饺子
huì zuò jiǎo zi
And make dumplings

5
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,833
