当当当当当当当当当当当
dāng dāng dāng dāng dāng dāng dāng dāng dāng dāng dāng
Bang bang bang bang bang bang bang bang bang bang bang

7
00:00:13,433 --> 00:00:15,300
然后就是剁馅
rán hòu jiù shì duò xiàn
Then they chop the filling

8
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:16,833
做包子的馅
zuò bāo zi de xiàn
The filling for the buns

9
00:00:16,833 --> 00:00:19,533
每天3点我就醒了
měi tiān sān diǎn wǒ jiù xǐng le
Every day at 3 a.m., I would wake up

10
00:00:19,533 --> 00:00:21,500
听起来有一点好笑
tīng qǐ lái yǒu yì diǎn hǎo xiào
It sounds kind of funny

11
00:00:21,833 --> 00:00:23,433
也有一点好吃
yě yǒu yì diǎn hǎo chī
And also kind of delicious

12
00:00:23,433 --> 00:00:24,733
大学的时候
dà xué de shí hòu
When I was in college

13
00:00:24,733 --> 00:00:26,100
我认识了Weixuan
wǒ rèn shì le Weixuan
I met Weixuan

14
