我怎么没有跟Weixuan借钱
wǒ zěn me méi yǒu gēn Weixuan jiè qián
Why didn’t I borrow money from Weixuan?

15
00:00:29,833 --> 00:00:32,000
她有这么多钱
tā yǒu zhè me duō qián
She had so much money

16
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,400
这么多钱
zhè me duō qián
So much money

17
00:00:33,433 --> 00:00:35,066
你跟我借钱
nǐ gēn wǒ jiè qián
If you borrow money from me

18
00:00:35,066 --> 00:00:37,600
我不一定会借给你
wǒ bù yí dìng huì jiè gěi nǐ
I might not lend it to you

19
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:40,333
你不是我男朋友
nǐ bú shì wǒ nán péng yǒu
You're not my boyfriend

20
00:00:40,333 --> 00:00:41,833
但是到最后
dàn shì dào zuì hòu
But in the end

21
00:00:41,866 --> 00:00:43,700
Zhifei说Weixuan
Zhifei shuō Weixuan
Zhifei said to Weixuan

22
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:45,400
我们没有时间了
wǒ men méi yǒu shí jiān le
We don’t have time

23
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:47,100
你不要去看它
nǐ bú yào qù kàn tā
Don’t look at it

24
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:48,933
好看不好看
hǎo kàn bù hǎo kàn
Whether it looks good or not

25
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:52,200
你把它做完就可以
nǐ bǎ tā zuò wán jiù kě yǐ
Just finish it and it’ll be fine

26
00:00:52,733 --> 00:00:56,033
在Instagram上也有很多人骂我们
zài Instagram shàng yě yǒu hěn duō rén mà wǒ men
On Instagram, a lot of people scolded us too

27
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:58,400
说你这个不好
shuō nǐ zhè gè bù hǎo
They said this is bad

28
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:01,400
坏老师很多人骂我们
huài lǎo shī hěn duō rén mà wǒ men
Bad teachers — many people scolded us

29
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:05,066
可是现在我们还是很好
kě shì xiàn zài wǒ men hái shì hěn hǎo
But now we’re still doing great

30
00:01:05,233 --> 00:01:07,233
那些骂我们的人
nà xiē mà wǒ men de rén
Those people who criticized us

31
00:01:07,233 --> 00:01:08,600
我不知道他们去哪了
wǒ bù zhī dào tā men qù nǎ le
I don’t know where they went

32
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:10,733
但是他们一定没有我们好
dàn shì tā men yí dìng méi yǒu wǒ men hǎo
But they definitely aren’t doing better than us

33
00:01:10,866 --> 00:01:15,500
大家好欢迎来到XiaoguaChinese的播客
dà jiā hǎo huān yíng lái dào XiaoguaChinese de bō kè
Hi everyone, welcome to the XiaoguaChinese podcast

34
00:01:16,066 --> 00:01:19,133
那今天是我Zhifei
