And Teacher Fanfan

36
00:01:21,333 --> 00:01:23,400
Weixuan老师一起
Weixuan lǎo shī yì qǐ
Together with Teacher Weixuan

37
00:01:23,633 --> 00:01:25,866
好
hǎo
Okay

38
00:01:26,066 --> 00:01:29,866
Weixuan我们今天要聊什么
Weixuan wǒ men jīn tiān yào liáo shén me
Weixuan, what are we talking about today?

39
00:01:30,666 --> 00:01:35,633
我们今天要聊一聊我们吃过的苦
wǒ men jīn tiān yào liáo yì liáo wǒ men chī guò de kǔ
Today we’re going to talk about the hardships we’ve experienced

40
00:01:36,233 --> 00:01:37,733
好
hǎo
Okay

41
00:01:37,900 --> 00:01:40,400
吃苦是什么意思
chī kǔ shì shén me yì si
What does “chīkǔ” (endure hardship) mean?

42
00:01:40,533 --> 00:01:45,933
吃苦就是什么事情让我们的生活很辛苦
chī kǔ jiù shì shén me shì qíng ràng wǒ men de shēng huó hěn xīn kǔ
It means things that made our life very difficult

43
00:01:46,033 --> 00:01:47,600
可以是工作
kě yǐ shì gōng zuò
It can be work

44
00:01:47,666 --> 00:01:50,800
可以是你的朋友
kě yǐ shì nǐ de péng yǒu
It can be your friends

45
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:52,800
也可以是你的
yě kě yǐ shì nǐ de
It can also be your...

46
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:55,100
你谈恋爱也可以吃苦
nǐ tán liàn ài yě kě yǐ chī kǔ
Being in a relationship can also be hard

47
00:01:55,233 --> 00:01:58,500
很多很多事情都可以让我们吃苦
hěn duō hěn duō shì qíng dōu kě yǐ ràng wǒ men chī kǔ
So many things can make us suffer

48
00:02:00,100 --> 00:02:03,733
让我们觉得辛苦很难的事情
ràng wǒ men jué de xīn kǔ hěn nán de shì qíng
Things that make us feel exhausted and challenged

49
00:02:03,733 --> 00:02:07,233
那我们吃苦
nà wǒ men chī kǔ
So when we say “eat bitterness”...

50
00:02:07,233 --> 00:02:10,000
Fanfan你这么漂亮
Fanfan nǐ zhè me piào liang
Fanfan, you’re so beautiful

51
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,133
这么可爱
zhè me kě ài
So cute

52
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:13,500
你吃过苦吗
nǐ chī guò kǔ ma
Have you ever suffered?

53
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:15,200
当然当然
dāng rán dāng rán
Of course, of course

54
00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:19,033
我觉得我从小到大都在吃苦
wǒ jué de wǒ cóng xiǎo dào dà dōu zài chī kǔ
I think I’ve been suffering since I was little

55
00:02:20,900 --> 00:02:23,900
很可怜
hěn kě lián
So pitiful

56
00:02:23,900 --> 00:02:26,400
Fanfan你想一想
Fanfan nǐ xiǎng yī xiǎng
Fanfan, think about it

57
00:02:26,533 --> 00:02:32,033
你觉得你吃过最大的苦是什么
nǐ jué de nǐ chī guò zuì dà de kǔ shì shén me
What do you think is the hardest thing you’ve been through?

58
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:39,400
我觉得我吃过最大的苦就是身体的苦
wǒ jué de wǒ chī guò zuì dà de kǔ jiù shì shēn tǐ de kǔ
I think the biggest hardship I’ve experienced is physical hardship

59
00:02:41,333 --> 00:02:48,000
我觉得 2015年的时候我去北京工作
wǒ jué de èr líng yī wǔ nián de shí hòu wǒ qù běi jīng gōng zuò
I think in 2015 I went to Beijing to work

60
00:02:48,866 --> 00:02:50,233
大家知道吗
dà jiā zhī dào ma
You guys know?

61
00:02:50,300 --> 00:02:54,666
在北京的房子非常非常得贵
zài běi jīng de fáng zi fēi cháng fēi cháng de guì
Housing in Beijing is extremely expensive

62
00:02:55,266 --> 00:02:57,000
那个时候呢
nà gè shí hòu ne
At that time

63
00:02:57,333 --> 00:02:58,533
我没有钱
wǒ méi yǒu qián
I had no money

64
00:02:59,300 --> 00:03:01,766
可是我要住对不对
kě shì wǒ yào zhù duì bù duì
But I needed a place to live, right?

65
00:03:01,766 --> 00:03:03,000
我要睡觉
wǒ yào shuì jiào
I needed to sleep

66
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,700
那怎么办呢
nà zěn me bàn ne
So what could I do?

67
00:03:05,133 --> 00:03:08,533
然后我选择了一个很便宜
rán hòu wǒ xuǎn zé le yí gè hěn pián yi
So I chose a very cheap place

68
00:03:08,533 --> 00:03:10,300
很便宜的房子
hěn pián yi de fáng zi
A very cheap apartment

69
00:03:11,266 --> 00:03:14,533
我觉得2015年的时候
wǒ jué de èr líng yī wǔ nián de shí hòu
I think back in 2015

70
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:22,266
那个房子一个月差不多 600块钱人民币
nà gè fáng zi yī gè yuè chà bù duō liù bǎi kuài qián rén mín bì
That apartment cost about 600 RMB per month

71
00:03:22,700 --> 00:03:23,633
好便宜
hǎo pián yi
So cheap

72
00:03:24,500 --> 00:03:25,866
对很便宜
duì hěn pián yi
Yeah, really cheap

73
00:03:26,066 --> 00:03:28,733
我当时非常地开心
wǒ dāng shí fēi cháng de kāi xīn
I was really happy at the time

74
00:03:28,733 --> 00:03:31,200
很高兴我想
hěn gāo xìng wǒ xiǎng
I thought, super happy

75
00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:34,000
我可以住这么便宜的房子
wǒ kě yǐ zhù zhè me pián yi de fáng zi
I can live in such a cheap apartment

76
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,433
太好了
tài hǎo le
That’s great

77
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:41,400
可是我去到了那个房子以后
kě shì wǒ qù dào le nà gè fáng zi yǐ hòu
But after I arrived at that apartment

78
00:03:42,133 --> 00:03:46,000
那个房子不是在一楼
nà gè fáng zi bú shì zài yì lóu
It wasn’t on the first floor

79
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,733
不是在二楼
bú shì zài èr lóu
Not on the second floor

80
00:03:47,733 --> 00:03:49,533
不是在三楼
bú shì zài sān lóu
Not on the third floor

81
00:03:49,666 --> 00:03:51,300
是在地下的
shì zài dì xià de
It was underground

82
00:03:51,300 --> 00:03:54,200
就是你要我们正常应该走楼梯
jiù shì nǐ yào wǒ men zhèng cháng yīng gāi zǒu lóu tī
Normally you walk up the stairs

83
00:03:54,200 --> 00:03:55,433
当当当当当
dāng dāng dāng dāng dāng
Step by step going up

84
00:03:55,433 --> 00:03:58,533
可是我要当当当当当这样走
kě shì wǒ yào dāng dāng dāng dāng dāng zhè yàng zǒu
But I had to walk down like this

85
00:03:58,533 --> 00:04:00,100
在地面以下的
zài dì miàn yǐ xià de
It was below ground level

86
00:04:00,266 --> 00:04:04,233
而且那个房子没有窗户
ér qiě nà gè fáng zi méi yǒu chuāng hù
And the apartment had no windows

87
00:04:04,733 --> 00:04:07,733
所以空气不太好
suǒ yǐ kōng qì bú tài hǎo
So the air wasn’t very good

88
00:04:08,066 --> 00:04:11,933
然后呢那个房间只有一张床
rán hòu ne nà gè fáng jiān zhǐ yǒu yì zhāng chuáng
And that room only had one bed

89
00:04:12,300 --> 00:04:14,933
我进到房间的时候
wǒ jìn dào fáng jiān de shí hòu
When I entered the room

90
00:04:14,933 --> 00:04:16,100
我要开灯
wǒ yào kāi dēng
I had to turn on the light

91
00:04:16,433 --> 00:04:18,633
因为如果我不开灯
yīn wèi rú guǒ wǒ bù kāi dēng
Because if I didn’t turn on the light

92
00:04:18,633 --> 00:04:22,466
那个房间就非常非常的黑
nà gè fáng jiān jiù fēi cháng fēi cháng de hēi
The room would be extremely dark

93
00:04:22,733 --> 00:04:28,133
听起来对身体不太好对不对
tīng qǐ lái duì shēn tǐ bú tài hǎo duì bù duì
Sounds unhealthy, right?

94
00:04:28,133 --> 00:04:30,733
对而且很不干净
duì ér qiě hěn bù gān jìng
Right, and also very dirty

95
00:04:30,933 --> 00:04:32,666
没有卫生间
méi yǒu wèi shēng jiān
There was no bathroom

96
00:04:32,666 --> 00:04:37,333
我要跟别人一起用一个卫生间
wǒ yào gēn bié rén yì qǐ yòng yí gè wèi shēng jiān
I had to share a bathroom with others

97
00:04:37,866 --> 00:04:41,000
还有每天早上3点
hái yǒu měi tiān zǎo shàng sān diǎn
Also, every day at 3 a.m.

98
00:04:41,133 --> 00:04:43,000
我会有一个闹钟
wǒ huì yǒu yí gè nào zhōng
I would have an “alarm clock”

99
00:04:43,400 --> 00:04:45,300
这个闹钟是什么呢
zhè gè nào zhōng shì shén me ne
What was this alarm clock?

100
00:04:45,700 --> 00:04:47,500
就是我的邻居
jiù shì wǒ de lín jū
It was my neighbor

101
00:04:47,933 --> 00:04:50,400
他们是卖早餐的
tā men shì mài zǎo cān de
They sold breakfast

102
00:04:50,666 --> 00:04:56,233
所以他们3点的时候会做包子
suǒ yǐ tā men sān diǎn de shí hòu huì zuò bāo zi
So they would start making buns at 3 a.m.

103
00:04:56,266 --> 00:04:57,800
会做饺子
huì zuò jiǎo zi
They made dumplings too

104
00:04:57,800 --> 00:05:01,466
然后他们开始当当当当当当当当当当
rán hòu tā men kāi shǐ dāng dāng dāng dāng dāng dāng dāng dāng dāng dāng
Then they started pounding — bang bang bang…

105
00:05:01,466 --> 00:05:03,600
然后就是剁馅
rán hòu jiù shì duò xiàn
Then it was chopping the filling

106
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:05,233
做包子的馅
zuò bāo zi de xiàn
For the buns

107
00:05:05,666 --> 00:05:10,066
所以每天3点我就醒了
suǒ yǐ měi tiān sān diǎn wǒ jiù xǐng le
So every day at 3 a.m., I would wake up

108
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:12,200
对不起
duì bù qǐ
I’m sorry

109
00:05:12,200 --> 00:05:15,133
Fanfan听起来有一点好笑
Fanfan tīng qǐ lái yǒu yì diǎn hǎo xiào
Fanfan, it sounds kind of funny

110
00:05:15,433 --> 00:05:17,266
也有一点好吃
yě yǒu yì diǎn hǎo chī
And kind of delicious too

111
00:05:18,100 --> 00:05:21,233
还有
hái yǒu
Also

112
00:05:21,233 --> 00:05:24,866
就是后来我给房东打电话
jiù shì hòu lái wǒ gěi fáng dōng dǎ diàn huà
Later, I called the landlord

113
00:05:24,933 --> 00:05:26,900
我跟他叫哥
wǒ gēn tā jiào gē
I called him “bro”

114
00:05:27,066 --> 00:05:30,533
你可以给我换一个房间吗
nǐ kě yǐ gěi wǒ huàn yí gè fáng jiān ma
Can you change my room?

115
00:05:30,733 --> 00:05:32,100
他说为什么
tā shuō wèi shén me
He said, why?

116
00:05:32,300 --> 00:05:33,933
我说我睡不着
wǒ shuō wǒ shuì bù zháo
I said, I can’t sleep

117
00:05:34,100 --> 00:05:36,066
而且空气不好
ér qiě kōng qì bù hǎo
And the air is bad

118
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:40,233
他说之前有一个女孩子
tā shuō zhī qián yǒu yí gè nǚ hái zi
He said a girl used to live there before

119
00:05:40,333 --> 00:05:42,800
在你的房间住了一年
zài nǐ de fáng jiān zhù le yì nián
She lived in your room for a year

120
00:05:42,866 --> 00:05:44,800
可是她觉得很好
kě shì tā jué de hěn hǎo
But she thought it was great

121
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:47,100
为什么你住不了
wèi shén me nǐ zhù bù liǎo
Why can’t you live there?

122
00:05:47,233 --> 00:05:49,000
我说那好吧
wǒ shuō nà hǎo ba
I said, okay then

123
00:05:49,066 --> 00:05:52,066
如果有更好一点的房间
rú guǒ yǒu gèng hǎo yì diǎn de fáng jiān
If there’s a slightly better room

124
00:05:52,066 --> 00:05:54,066
你可以给我打电话吗
nǐ kě yǐ gěi wǒ dǎ diàn huà ma
Could you call me?

125
00:05:54,100 --> 00:05:56,100
你可以给我换一个吗
nǐ kě yǐ gěi wǒ huàn yí gè ma
Can you change one for me?

126
00:05:56,133 --> 00:05:57,533
他说好好好
tā shuō hǎo hǎo hǎo
He said, okay okay okay

127
00:05:58,033 --> 00:06:00,800
然后一个星期以后
rán hòu yí gè xīng qī yǐ hòu
Then, one week later

128
00:06:01,100 --> 00:06:03,700
他给我换了一个房间
tā gěi wǒ huàn le yí gè fáng jiān
He gave me a different room

129
00:06:04,333 --> 00:06:08,466
但是那个房间没有门
dàn shì nà gè fáng jiān méi yǒu mén
But that room didn’t have a door

130
00:06:09,033 --> 00:06:10,200
你们想一想
nǐ men xiǎng yì xiǎng
Just think about it

131
00:06:10,266 --> 00:06:14,300
一个女孩子住在很多很多人的地方
yí gè nǚ hái zi zhù zài hěn duō hěn duō rén de dì fāng
A girl living in a place with lots and lots of people

132
00:06:14,433 --> 00:06:18,266
连门都没有是很危险的对不对
lián mén dōu méi yǒu shì hěn wēi xiǎn de duì bù duì
Without even a door — that’s really dangerous, right?

133
00:06:18,266 --> 00:06:20,466
对对对
duì duì duì
Right, right

134
00:06:20,466 --> 00:06:23,100
如果没有门怎么住
rú guǒ méi yǒu mén zěn me zhù
How can you live without a door?

135
00:06:23,933 --> 00:06:26,466
可是他有一个帘子
kě shì tā yǒu yí gè lián zi
But he had a curtain

136
00:06:27,033 --> 00:06:29,333
这个帘子
zhè gè lián zi
This curtain…

137
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:35,466
还有一件我很让我觉得很不好
hái yǒu yí jiàn wǒ hěn ràng wǒ jué de hěn bù hǎo
There was another thing that made me feel really bad

138
00:06:35,466 --> 00:06:37,033
很不好的事情
hěn bù hǎo de shì qing
A very unpleasant thing

139
00:06:37,433 --> 00:06:39,966
我换了一个邻居对吗
wǒ huàn le yí gè lín jū duì ma
I had a new neighbor, right?

140
00:06:39,966 --> 00:06:41,700
我的这个邻居
wǒ de zhè gè lín jū
This neighbor of mine

141
00:06:41,700 --> 00:06:43,933
她是一个女孩子
tā shì yí gè nǚ hái zi
She was a young woman

142
00:06:44,733 --> 00:06:49,900
可是白天的时候我从来都没有看到她
kě shì bái tiān de shí hòu wǒ cóng lái dōu méi yǒu kàn dào tā
But I never saw her during the day

143
00:06:49,900 --> 00:06:51,400
没有见过她
méi yǒu jiàn guò tā
I never saw her

144
00:06:51,866 --> 00:06:54,466
那晚上的时候
nà wǎn shàng de shí hòu
But at night

145
00:06:55,266 --> 00:06:58,500
我会听到她带不同的男人回来
wǒ huì tīng dào tā dài bù tóng de nán rén huí lái
I would hear her bring back different men

146
00:06:58,800 --> 00:07:03,933
然后因为她做的是一个特殊的工作
rán hòu yīn wèi tā zuò de shì yí gè tè shū de gōng zuò
Because she was doing a special kind of work

147
00:07:04,200 --> 00:07:09,433
所以每天晚上她的房间会很吵很吵
suǒ yǐ měi tiān wǎn shàng tā de fáng jiān huì hěn chǎo hěn chǎo
So every night her room was very, very noisy

148
00:07:09,500 --> 00:07:11,666
她在做生意
tā zài zuò shēng yì
She was doing “business”

149
00:07:11,866 --> 00:07:15,800
有音乐会
yǒu yīn yuè huì
There were music concerts (sarcastically)

150
00:07:16,066 --> 00:07:17,433
对对对
duì duì duì
Yes, yes

151
00:07:17,533 --> 00:07:18,733
有啪啪啪
yǒu pā pā pā
There was "boom boom boom" (innuendo)

152
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:20,500
所以对对
suǒ yǐ duì duì
Yeah, so yeah

153
00:07:20,500 --> 00:07:23,533
哈哈天呐
hā hā tiān na
Haha oh my god

154
00:07:23,533 --> 00:07:26,933
我觉得太难了太难了
wǒ jué de tài nán le tài nán le
I think it was way too hard

155
00:07:26,933 --> 00:07:28,300
太难了
tài nán le
Really hard

156
00:07:28,533 --> 00:07:32,033
Fanfan你在那里住了多久
Fanfan nǐ zài nà lǐ zhù le duō jiǔ
Fanfan, how long did you live there?

157
00:07:33,933 --> 00:07:34,733
半年
