Half a year

158
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:36,900
你很厉害
nǐ hěn lì hài
You’re amazing

159
00:07:39,100 --> 00:07:40,300
不容易
bù róng yì
That’s not easy

160
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:43,100
是的我觉得太苦了
shì de wǒ jué de tài kǔ le
Yeah, I think it was way too bitter (hard)

161
00:07:44,466 --> 00:07:45,533
Weixuan呢
Weixuan ne
What about you, Weixuan?

162
00:07:45,533 --> 00:07:50,333
你觉得你可以住这样的地方吗
nǐ jué de nǐ kě yǐ zhù zhè yàng de dì fāng ma
Do you think you could live in a place like that?

163
00:07:51,066 --> 00:07:51,733
我不可以
wǒ bù kě yǐ
I couldn’t

164
00:07:51,733 --> 00:07:53,000
完全不可以
wán quán bù kě yǐ
Absolutely not

165
00:07:53,233 --> 00:07:54,100
绝对不行
jué duì bù xíng
Definitely not

166
00:07:55,066 --> 00:07:57,900
我是对我睡觉的地方是有要求的
wǒ shì duì wǒ shuì jiào de dì fāng shì yǒu yāo qiú de
I have standards for where I sleep

167
00:07:57,900 --> 00:07:59,633
就是要安静
jiù shì yào ān jìng
It has to be quiet

168
