然后要干净
rán hòu yào gān jìng
And it has to be clean

170
00:08:02,033 --> 00:08:03,433
然后要安全
rán hòu yào ān quán
And it has to be safe

171
00:08:03,433 --> 00:08:04,700
这个是很重要
zhè gè shì hěn zhòng yào
That’s very important

172
00:08:04,866 --> 00:08:07,266
所以如果没有门
suǒ yǐ rú guǒ méi yǒu mén
So if there’s no door

173
00:08:07,666 --> 00:08:09,200
我会很害怕
wǒ huì hěn hài pà
I would be very scared

174
00:08:09,200 --> 00:08:13,666
我怕有人或者有别的动物可能会进来
wǒ pà yǒu rén huò zhě yǒu bié de dòng wù kě néng huì jìn lái
I’m afraid someone or some animal might come in

175
00:08:13,666 --> 00:08:15,733
所以我没有办法睡觉
suǒ yǐ wǒ méi yǒu bàn fǎ shuì jiào
So I wouldn’t be able to sleep

176
00:08:16,200 --> 00:08:17,933
所以我不行
suǒ yǐ wǒ bù xíng
So no, I couldn’t do it

177
00:08:17,933 --> 00:08:20,000
我不能睡这样的房间
wǒ bù néng shuì zhè yàng de fáng jiān
I can’t sleep in that kind of room

178
00:08:20,733 --> 00:08:22,500
我也觉得很难
wǒ yě jué de hěn nán
I also think it’s very difficult

179
00:08:22,900 --> 00:08:25,700
Weixuan你吃过什么苦
Weixuan nǐ chī guò shén me kǔ
Weixuan, what hardships have you gone through?

180
00:08:26,100 --> 00:08:29,100
我好像没有因为钱吃苦
wǒ hǎo xiàng méi yǒu yīn wèi qián chī kǔ
I don’t think I’ve suffered because of money

181
00:08:29,100 --> 00:08:34,666
但是我可能吃过的最大的苦
dàn shì wǒ kě néng chī guò de zuì dà de kǔ
But maybe the biggest hardship I’ve had

182
00:08:34,666 --> 00:08:37,233
是爱情的苦
shì ài qíng de kǔ
Is the hardship of love

183
00:08:37,233 --> 00:08:38,933
就是谈恋爱的苦
jiù shì tán liàn ài de kǔ
The pain of being in a relationship

184
00:08:42,033 --> 00:08:43,666
好说说
hǎo shuō shuō
Okay, tell us

185
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:46,866
说说
shuō shuō
Tell us more

186
00:08:46,866 --> 00:08:49,000
觉得我是一个恋爱脑
jué de wǒ shì yí gè liàn ài nǎo
I think I have “love brain” (love-obsessed mindset)

187
00:08:49,100 --> 00:08:52,000
恋爱脑就是我有了男朋友以后
liàn ài nǎo jiù shì wǒ yǒu le nán péng yǒu yǐ hòu
Love brain means once I have a boyfriend

188
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:54,400
我就不想别的事情了
wǒ jiù bù xiǎng bié de shì qíng le
I don’t think about anything else

189
00:08:54,400 --> 00:08:57,933
我的脑子里面只有谈恋爱
wǒ de nǎo zi lǐ miàn zhǐ yǒu tán liàn ài
My mind is full of just “being in love”

190
00:08:57,933 --> 00:09:00,900
这三个字就只有这一件事情
zhè sān gè zì jiù zhǐ yǒu zhè yí jiàn shì qíng
Just those three characters (tán liàn ài) — that one thing

191
00:09:01,100 --> 00:09:03,433
所以我的男朋友
suǒ yǐ wǒ de nán péng yǒu
So my boyfriend

192
