00:09:12,866 --> 00:09:17,100
所以我的男朋友他会和我借钱
suǒ yǐ wǒ de nán péng yǒu tā huì hé wǒ jiè qián
My boyfriend would borrow money from me

197
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:19,100
然后我说好
rán hòu wǒ shuō hǎo
And I said okay

198
00:09:19,100 --> 00:09:20,666
没问题
méi wèn tí
No problem

199
00:09:20,666 --> 00:09:23,100
我就把我的钱借给他
wǒ jiù bǎ wǒ de qián jiè gěi tā
I just gave him my money

200
00:09:24,466 --> 00:09:29,733
但是我们分手的时候
dàn shì wǒ men fēn shǒu de shí hòu
But when we broke up

201
00:09:29,733 --> 00:09:32,300
他不把钱还给我
tā bù bǎ qián huán gěi wǒ
He didn’t give me the money back

202
00:09:33,066 --> 00:09:37,500
所以我总是给别人钱
suǒ yǐ wǒ zǒng shì gěi bié rén qián
So I kept giving people money

203
00:09:37,500 --> 00:09:40,666
但是我的钱不回来
dàn shì wǒ de qián bù huí lái
But my money never came back

204
00:09:40,733 --> 00:09:44,533
所以这个可能是我吃的最大的苦
suǒ yǐ zhè gè kě néng shì wǒ chī de zuì dà de kǔ
So maybe this was the hardest thing I’ve gone through

205
00:09:44,666 --> 00:09:46,933
就是我总是给别人钱
jiù shì wǒ zǒng shì gěi bié rén qián
Always giving others money

206
00:09:47,700 --> 00:09:49,433
我怎么不知道
wǒ zěn me bù zhī dào
How did I not know about this?

207
00:09:49,833 --> 00:09:53,433
因为大学的时候我认识了Weixuan
yīn wèi dà xué de shí hòu wǒ rèn shi le Weixuan
Because I met Weixuan in university

208
00:09:54,133 --> 00:09:57,733
我怎么没有跟Weixuan借钱
wǒ zěn me méi yǒu gēn Weixuan jiè qián
Why didn’t I borrow money from Weixuan?

209
00:09:57,933 --> 00:10:00,066
她有这么多钱
tā yǒu zhè me duō qián
She had so much money

210
00:10:00,066 --> 00:10:01,466
这么多钱
zhè me duō qián
So much money

211
