232
00:11:13,333 --> 00:11:15,333
他们对你好吗
tā men duì nǐ hǎo ma
Were they good to you?

233
00:11:15,633 --> 00:11:18,433
一开始的时候很好很好
yì kāi shǐ de shí hòu hěn hǎo hěn hǎo
At first, they were very very good

234
00:11:18,466 --> 00:11:19,933
所以我觉得
suǒ yǐ wǒ jué de
So I thought

235
00:11:19,933 --> 00:11:21,333
他是一个很好的人
tā shì yí gè hěn hǎo de rén
He was a really good person

236
00:11:21,433 --> 00:11:24,100
他需要我的帮助
tā xū yào wǒ de bāng zhù
He needed my help

237
00:11:24,300 --> 00:11:25,700
他需要钱
tā xū yào qián
He needed money

238
00:11:25,800 --> 00:11:27,466
我把我的钱给他
wǒ bǎ wǒ de qián gěi tā
I gave him my money

239
00:11:27,833 --> 00:11:31,233
可是后来我觉得
kě shì hòu lái wǒ jué de
But later, I felt

240
00:11:31,233 --> 00:11:35,133
好像他只喜欢我的钱
hǎo xiàng tā zhǐ xǐ huān wǒ de qián
Like he only liked my money

241
00:11:35,466 --> 00:11:38,333
好像他不是非常的喜欢我
hǎo xiàng tā bù shì fēi cháng de xǐ huān wǒ
As if he didn’t really like me that much

242
00:11:39,066 --> 00:11:41,466
他也不是因为觉得
tā yě bù shì yīn wèi jué de
It’s not because he thought

243
00:11:41,466 --> 00:11:43,100
Weixuan很可爱
Weixuan hěn kě ài
Weixuan was cute

244
00:11:43,133 --> 00:11:44,700
Weixuan很漂亮
Weixuan hěn piào liang
Or that Weixuan was pretty

245
00:11:44,733 --> 00:11:47,400
所以要和Weixuan在一起
suǒ yǐ yào hé Weixuan zài yì qǐ
So he wanted to be with Weixuan

246
00:11:47,466 --> 00:11:50,500
他可能会觉得Weixuan很有钱
tā kě néng huì jué de Weixuan hěn yǒu qián
He probably thought Weixuan was rich

247
00:11:50,500 --> 00:11:54,300
哈哈哈所以我要和她在一起
hā hā hā suǒ yǐ wǒ yào hé tā zài yì qǐ
Haha, so he wanted to be with her for that

248
00:11:54,933 --> 00:11:57,033
然后我就很生气
rán hòu wǒ jiù hěn shēng qì
Then I got really angry

249
00:11:57,933 --> 00:12:00,066
所以我说不行不行
suǒ yǐ wǒ shuō bù xíng bù xíng
So I said, no, no

250
00:12:00,066 --> 00:12:02,066
我们不能不可以在一起
wǒ men bù néng bù kě yǐ zài yì qǐ
We can’t be together

251
00:12:02,066 --> 00:12:03,533
我要和你分手
wǒ yào hé nǐ fēn shǒu
I want to break up with you

252
