那是不是到我了
nà shì bù shì dào wǒ le
So is it my turn now?

253
00:12:08,066 --> 00:12:11,100
对对对你有什么苦Zhifei
duì duì duì nǐ yǒu shén me kǔ Zhifei
Yes yes yes, what hardships have you had, Zhifei?

254
00:12:11,100 --> 00:12:12,666
快说一说
kuài shuō yì shuō
Come on, tell us

255
00:12:12,833 --> 00:12:15,400
你应该吃过很多苦
nǐ yīng gāi chī guò hěn duō kǔ
You must’ve gone through a lot

256
00:12:15,733 --> 00:12:20,066
我吃过什么苦Weixuan
wǒ chī guò shén me kǔ Weixuan
What hardship have I been through, Weixuan?

257
00:12:20,066 --> 00:12:21,433
男人的苦
nán rén de kǔ
